         fhir:equivalence [ fhir:v "equivalent" ] ;
         fhir:comment [ fhir:v "Element `RequestOrchestration.groupIdentifier` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `RequestGroup.groupIdentifier` as `Equivalent`.\nRequests are linked either by a \"basedOn\" relationship (i.e. one request is fulfilling another) or by having a common requisition.  Requests that are part of the same requisition are generally treated independently from the perspective of changing their state or maintaining them after initial creation." ]
